<p>You make a low blow against a sensitive point on the target, dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">176%, 187%, 196%, 203%, 210%</acronym> unarmed damage. If your attack hits, the target is left reeling and vulnerable, reducing their physical save by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 11, 16, 21, 25</acronym> and their stun, blind, confusion and pin immunities to 50% of normal for 4 turns.</p><p>This effect bypasses saves.</p>